info_description = "Dispatchable knowledge tower. The hawk flies at 100 px per second, rotates toward the cursor while dispatched, and scans with a forward blue arc. Red viruses add 1 temporary knowledge point and Trojan Horses add 5. Temporary points deposit into the Progress HUD only when the hawk lands back on its headquarters pad, extracting 1 point every 3 seconds. LV1 does not attack while landed; LV2 and above can shoot only while dispatched."
